+# XS Location 🎯
+
+**XS Location 2.0** is a streamlined, bilingual (Arabic/English) iOS app with two clearly labelled methods: **LocalDevVPN + Pairing** for developer location simulation, and **Local VPN / Network** for Wi-Fi and cellular location-response testing without a pairing file. Tap a map, follow the three setup steps, and start or stop from one screen.
+
+**[Open the XS Location setup guide / دليل الاستخدام بالعربي](README-XS.md)** — includes GitHub Actions IPA build steps and honest requirements for Packet Tunnel entitlements.
+
+The material below documents the original **Locus** engine on which XS Location is based (MIT licensed). Some advanced features and the historical screenshots below belong to the upstream UI; the simplified XS Location start screen intentionally does not display them.
+
+---
+
+# Original Locus project documentation
 
 Free and open-source iPhone location teleport. Tap the map, search a place, or drive a route — Locus injects coordinates through Apple’s **developer location service** into `locationd`, so Maps and other apps see the spoofed GPS (not just a Wi‑Fi lookup that outdoor GPS will overwrite).
 
